OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAA&E repair cash branded 'sticking
OL,4,Aplaster'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Stockton West Conservative MP Matt
OL,7,FVickers said the hospital required more
OL,8,Ffunding. "North Tees is an ageing,
OL,9,Fcrumbling hospital, and local people
OL,10,Fhave been clear that it requires a
OL,11,Fsignificant investment," he said.
OL,12,F"Labour still haven't committed a penny
OL,13,Ftowards it."
OL,15,FThe government said it was seeking to
OL,16,Fboost frontline and urgent care
OL,17,Fcapacity in the NHS ahead of the
OL,18,Fwinter.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
